    "detailed_description": "\u300aYou, Calligrapher\u300bis an authentic VR Calligraphy simulator.<br><br>In\u300aYou, Calligrapher\u300b, you will be empowered to imitate the masterpieces of poets and scholars, draw and paint with traditional ink pen. Experience the culture of Calligraphy with your own hands!<br><br>The game is  100% compatible with <strong>Oculus Quest</strong> and <strong>Rift</strong>, please use airlink or alvr to connect.<br>And also compatible with <strong>Valve Index</strong>, <strong>HTC</strong> and <strong>WMR</strong> devices.<br><br>Find us in Discord:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593700/extras/b72f4f082a09173608747f943d2b13f6.poster.avif?t=1697601243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593700/extras/b72f4f082a09173608747f943d2b13f6.webm?t=1697601243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593700/extras/b72f4f082a09173608747f943d2b13f6.mp4?t=1697601243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Realistic ink brush physics<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593700/extras/11546637838391b40b433b798c1f863f.poster.avif?t=1697601243\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593700/extras/11546637838391b40b433b798c1f863f.webm?t=1697601243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593700/extras/11546637838391b40b433b798c1f863f.mp4?t=1697601243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Mutiple mixable Colours<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"htt